cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use InfoVoto / Voti in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "InfoVoto Perú 2026 (\"Voti\") — a responsible-AI citizen electoral assistant"
abstract: >-
  Voti is an open, non-partisan AI assistant that helps Peruvian citizens vote
  informed, grounded in official electoral data (JNE, ONPE) and designed never to
  issue a voting recommendation. It combines a latency-budgeted two-pass LLM agent,
  Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool orchestration over six electoral-domain servers,
  retrieval-augmented generation over candidate profiles, and a responsible-AI output
  filter, deployed on Google Cloud Run.
type: software
authors:
